    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "839381076": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "With so much debt hanging over us, life isn't easy, but we manage.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2001900401": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Adrian and I started working soon after, and {D} was able to find a job as a manager at a local supermarket. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1818829890": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We're no longer rich, but life isn't bad. In the end, we all find happiness in this new, normal life.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
